            "review_title": "Review at Ken Ha Noi",
            "review_text": "Вероника Т\n4 contributions\n0\nOne of the best places in Nha Trang!\nSep 2025 • Couples\nVery cool restaurant with nice prices, large portions and cool atmosphere. The food here is delicious, not only for lunches but also for dinners. I don't know what happened in 2019, but now in 2025 they cook wonderfully, and again delicious. And the walls of this institution are painted with wishes and autographs of people. And you can see from these walls the geography of the people who visited this restaurant. If there is a chance to return to Nha Trang I will definitely visit this place again!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten October 2, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
