            "review_title": "Review at Ken Ha Noi",
            "review_text": "Екатерина Т\n1 contribution\n0\nIt's a very cozy environment, all clean. It's delicious, you'll lick your fingers. Family runs a cafe, everything is homemade!!!\nApr 2025 • Family\nIt's a very cozy environment, all clean. It's delicious, you'll lick your fingers. Family runs a cafe, everything is homemade!!! We got there once and went there only for the whole trip 12 days twice a day. The portions are big, the prices are lower than in other cafes. Next time we come back to them let's go - thank you for your work and atmosphere. Everyone should go there and make sure it has great coffee.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten May 7, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
