            "review_title": "Review at Ken Ha Noi",
            "review_text": "HappyTravellerBucks\nAbingdon, United Kingdom30 contributions\n0\nDon't be put off...\nJan 2020\n...by the more famous Yens next door. Ken is just as good - if not better - and certainly much better value. They realised immediately we weren't Russian when I looked puzzled at the menu in Russian. A big smile and a laugh and the lovely girl brought a menu in English. Choice is huge and service was worthy of a tip - food is delicious and Saigon White 10kVND!! To those who criticise the service - try smiling and being pleasant rather than barking with a frosty face.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 16, 2020",
            "rating": 4.0,
