            "review_text": "RiBo92\nStuttgart, Germany26 contributions\n0\nBest restaurant in Nha Trang\nMay 2019 • Couples\nWe went here like 4 times in a few days, on the one side because the food is awesome and really authentic and on the other hand the people working here are incredible friendly and very nice to us. Even offered us to drive us to train station, gave us some desserts and smiled all the time. Didn't met anywhere in Vietnam so awesome people like here in the restaurant. Can totally recommend :)\nRead more\nWritten May 7, 2019",
