            "review_title": "Review at Ken Ha Noi",
            "review_text": "David H\nDymchurch, United Kingdom164 contributions\n0\nGo here, not next door.\nApr 2019 • Couples\nThis place serves good food and the staff are very pleasant and attentive. The beer and food is also much cheaper than Yen's next door. I believe I have reviewed Yen's --- nothing really wrong with it, and it's usually packed, it's just that, in my opinion there is much better value to be had here.\nDo not be put off by the fact that it is not usually busy. This caused me to avoid it for many weeks, and it proved to be a misleading sign.\nThere is a step at the front of the restaurant, but the staff are ready and willing to assist with any wheelchair-users.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten April 13, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
